侯。累遷侍中，南郡太守。習于法令，政號平理，雖無赫赫之譽，久而見思。曉音樂，習歌舞，善與人交，貴遊之中，聲名籍甚。","note":"本句按敘述視點回指主。","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-021-wangchong","book_id":"b-nanshi-021","work_id":"w-nanshi","source_id":"s-nanshi-021-wangchong-ws1752646"},{"start":42,"end":46,"surface":"新安公主","id":"c-nanshi-021-wangchong:p001:r0042","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-021-wangchong:p001","person_id":"3wk_sv9_63j","referent_role":"third_person","quote":"沖字長深，弘玄孫也。祖僧衍，位侍中。父茂璋字胤光，仕梁位給事黃門侍郎。沖母，梁武帝妹新安公主，卒于齊世。武帝深鍾愛沖，賜爵東安亭侯。累遷侍中，南郡太守。習于法令，政號平理，雖無赫赫之譽，久而見思。曉音樂，習歌舞，善與人交，貴遊之中，聲名籍甚。","note":"本句按敘述視點回指主。","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-021-wangchong","book_id":"b-nanshi-021","work_id":"w-nanshi","source_id":"s-nanshi-021-wangchong-ws1752646"}],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-nanshi-021-wangchong:p001","text":"沖字長深，弘玄孫也。祖僧衍，位侍中。父茂璋字胤光，仕梁位給事黃門侍郎。沖母，梁武帝妹新安公主，卒于齊世。武帝深鍾愛沖，賜爵東安亭侯。累遷侍中，南郡太守。習于法令，政號平理，雖無赫赫之譽，久而見思。曉音樂，習歌舞，善與人交，貴遊之中，聲名籍甚。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"start":0,"end":1,"surface":"沖","id":"c-nanshi-021-wangchong:p001:m0000","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAAABAA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作沖。"},{"start":2,"end":4,"surface":"長深","id":"c-nanshi-021-wangchong:p001:m0002","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAAABAA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作沖。"},{"start":5,"end":6,"surface":"弘","id":"c-nanshi-021-wangchong:p001:m0005","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作弘。"},{"start":11,"end":13,"surface":"僧衍","id":"c-nanshi-021-wangchong:p001:m0011","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAAAB","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作僧衍。"},{"start":19,"end":21,"surface":"茂璋","id":"c-nanshi-021-wangchong:p001:m0019","person_id":"7r6